---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ExternalLink from '../components/ExternalLink.astro';

const app = 'https://github.com/albertoarena/sudo-play';
const site = 'https://github.com/albertoarena/sudo-play-docs';
---
<Base title="Credits" description="The open-source tools behind the Sudo Play app and this site, the person who made it, and the licences that cover both.">
  <h1>Credits</h1>
  <p class="lead">Sudo Play and this site are built with these open-source tools.</p>

  <h2>The app</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong><ExternalLink href="https://laravel.com/">Laravel</ExternalLink></strong> and <strong><ExternalLink href="https://nativephp.com/">NativePHP</ExternalLink></strong>: the app itself, packaged as a macOS menu bar app.</li>
    <li><strong><ExternalLink href="https://inertiajs.com/">Inertia</ExternalLink></strong> and <strong><ExternalLink href="https://vuejs.org/">Vue</ExternalLink></strong>, with <strong><ExternalLink href="https://tailwindcss.com/">Tailwind CSS</ExternalLink></strong>: the interface.</li>
    <li><strong><ExternalLink href="https://pestphp.com/">Pest</ExternalLink></strong> on <strong><ExternalLink href="https://phpunit.de/">PHPUnit</ExternalLink></strong>, and <strong><ExternalLink href="https://vitest.dev/">Vitest</ExternalLink></strong>: the app and interface tests.</li>
    <li><strong><ExternalLink href="https://github.com/larastan/larastan">Larastan</ExternalLink></strong> and <strong><ExternalLink href="https://laravel.com/docs/pint">Pint</ExternalLink></strong>: static analysis and code style.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>This site</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong><ExternalLink href="https://astro.build/">Astro</ExternalLink></strong> and <strong><ExternalLink href="https://www.typescriptlang.org/">TypeScript</ExternalLink></strong>: a static site that ships one small script, the consent banner.</li>
    <li><strong><ExternalLink href="https://vercel.com/font">Geist Mono</ExternalLink></strong>: the typeface, served from this site under the SIL Open Font License.</li>
    <li><strong><ExternalLink href="https://vitest.dev/">Vitest</ExternalLink></strong>, <strong><ExternalLink href="https://playwright.dev/">Playwright</ExternalLink></strong> and <strong><ExternalLink href="https://github.com/dequelabs/axe-core">axe-core</ExternalLink></strong>: the build, browser and accessibility tests.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Author</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><ExternalLink href="https://github.com/albertoarena">Alberto Arena</ExternalLink></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Licence</h2>
  <p>Sudo Play is open-source software under the <ExternalLink href={`${app}/blob/main/LICENSE`}>MIT licence</ExternalLink>. This site's code is <ExternalLink href={`${site}/blob/main/LICENSE`}>MIT</ExternalLink> too, and its text is <ExternalLink href={`${site}/blob/main/LICENSE-CONTENT`}>CC BY 4.0</ExternalLink>. The name and mark are covered by the app's <ExternalLink href={`${app}/blob/main/TRADEMARK.md`}>trademark policy</ExternalLink>.</p>
</Base>
